(window.LART=window.LART||{})["字符串/kmp/kmp自动机"]="<p>增加一个字符$ch$，将会匹配到哪一个位置。</p>\n\n<p>暴力跳$next$数组是$O(n)$。处理出<code>kmp</code>自动机，$O(1)$得到失配位置。</p>\n\n<p>本质上是只有一个串的ac自动机。</p>\n<h2>实现</h2>\n<p>求kmp自动机时，不能暴力跳失配指针。</p>\n\n<p>记忆化搜索的方式，利用之前的结果。</p>\n<h3>写法1</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">int ne[N];\nint ne2[N][26];\nint get_next(int p, char c) {\n    if (ne2[p][c - 'a'] != -1) {\n        return ne2[p][c - 'a'];\n    }\n    if (s[p + 1] == c) {\n        return ne2[p][c - 'a'] = p;\n    }\n    if (!p) {\n        return ne2[p][c - 'a'] = 0;\n    }\n    return ne2[p][c - 'a'] = get_next(ne[p], c);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>写法2</h3>\n<p>写<code>lambda</code>函数递归。</p>\n\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">vector&lt;int&gt; ne(m + 1);\n\nfor (int i = 2, j = 0; i &lt;= m; ++i) {\n    while (j &amp;&amp; t[j + 1] != t[i]) {\n        j = ne[j];\n    }\n    if (t[j + 1] == t[i]) {\n        ++j;\n    }\n    ne[i] = j;\n}\n\nvector&lt;vector&lt;int&gt;&gt; z(m + 1, vector&lt;int&gt;(26, -1));\n\nfunction&lt;int(char, int)&gt; get = [&amp;](char ch, int j) {\n    if (z[j][ch - 'a'] &gt;= 0) {\n        return z[j][ch - 'a'];\n    }\n    if (ch == t[j + 1]) {\n        return z[j][ch - 'a'] = j + 1;\n    }\n    if (!j) {\n        return z[j][ch - 'a'] = j;\n    }\n    return z[j][ch - 'a'] = get(ch, ne[j]);\n};\n</code></pre>\n<h1>习题</h1>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>题号</th>\n<th>链接</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>P3082</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P3082\">Necklace G</a></td>\n<td>kmp自动机+dp</td>\n<td>青题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CF808G</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/808/G\">Anthem of Berland</a></td>\n<td>kmp自动机得到如果是ch将会匹配到哪里</td>\n<td>2300/青题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>105423H</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://codeforces.com/gym/105423/problem/H\">经文</a></td>\n<td>kmp自动机+计数dp</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n";
